WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.340
Episode 16

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.340
Condemned Criminal in the
Underground Jail of Planet Bemera<i>!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.340
( Air date: Jan 19, 1975 )

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.800
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.600
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:40.750
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.040
Space Battleship

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.040
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:44.200
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.610
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.000
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:03.800
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:10.600
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:17.300
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:40.840
In 2199, Earth was attacked by Meteor
Bombs from the mysterious planet Gamilus...

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.420
{SONO}...and mankind was facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive contamination.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:04.010
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.960
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.810
Galactic System

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:16.320
Iscandar is 148,000 light years
away in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:16.860
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:22.620
Galactic System

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:21.700
Yamato's Course

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:22.620
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.970
{GENZAI}Their current destination
is the mid point, planet Balan.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.620
Planet Balan

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:24.110
Balan appears to be a beacon
in space for the Yamato...

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.220
...but it's also a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.760
Planet Balan

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:34.680
{Domel}After being assigned as commander
of the Solar System region operations...

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:38.710
{Domel}...a famed admiral, Domel, has just
arrived on planet Balan with his fleet.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.660
{BALAN}Using Balan as
his main base...

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:45.340
{BALAN}...Admiral Domel is like a space wolf
sharpening its fangs to kill the Yamato.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.460
Admiral Domel

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.440
The Yamato is 20 days
away from planet Balan.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.020
I'm so hungry.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.270
What is it today ?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.580
The same one again ?
I'm getting sick of it.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:16.820
Kodai, you shouldn't
ask too much.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:19.200
Don't think about complaining,
just try to have fun.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.210
How do I look ?

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:30.570
Today, it's arranged in the style
of Cardin of 20th Century France.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.710
Titled,
"For the Roses."

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.820
The model is Miss Mori Yuki.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.220
Way to go, Analyzer !

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.050
No !

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.760
You're a very well
made robot, indeed.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.770
You have emotions
just like us.

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:02.730
I'm human.
I do what I want to do.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:08.430
So, not just flipping up her skirt,
if you feel like kissing her, you'd do it ?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.510
I would.
A kiss or even farther...

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.910
"Even farther...?"
Hey, wait a minute.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:19.020
You're supposed to control yourself
about that. That's what humans do.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.840
If I suppress myself,
I'll break.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.690
It's a robot, after all.

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.560
I'm human.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.710
Oh, is that so ?

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.780
What're your plans
for Yuki now ?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.810
Marriage.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:34.910
Say what ?

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.010
That's a problem.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:45.760
Captain, I'm not asking you
to destroy the Analyzer.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:50.760
It's about its habit of flipping
up my skirt up high like this...

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:57.820
{AREWA}It must be because of a design flaw
in its circuits, so I want it to be fixed.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.720
{MURI}Am I asking
something impossible ?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:06.430
It might not be a
good idea to remove it.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.850
What did you say ?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.520
Well, it might not be possible,
but I'll discuss it with Mr. Sanada.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.060
Thank you.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:22.500
Captain, we've found a planet
with plants.  Should we get closer ?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.610
Go ahead and approach.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.210
Planet Bemera

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.290
Altitude, 23,000.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:36.500
Stop at 20,000.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.410
Stop at 20,000.
Braking now.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.760
Mori.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:05:59.460
Sir ?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:03.110
We can see heavy vegetation
even from this distance.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:08.460
Your mission is to investigate
the surface and find edible plants.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.510
Got that ?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:16.890
Understood.  Chief Environmental
Commander Mori will accompany Analyzer...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.780
...and investigate
the surface.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.300
I hope they
don't mess up.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.970
Chief Environmental Commander...

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.890
What is it ?

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.360
Will you marry me ?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.520
How could you say that
while I'm piloting ?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.360
This hurts.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.780
Are you damaged ?

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:06.650
No, none.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.450
I wish you had been.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:11.970
Now, move.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.780
I want to stay like
this for a while.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.790
Analyzer, analyze
the air composition.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.710
What is that ?

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.630
It looks like an
anthill or a beehive.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.930
Let's go.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.020
Strange.  I wonder
if anyone's here.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:12.590
Let's go in.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:22.010
Communications have
been cut off.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.550
Hey, what happened ?

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:25.540
Captain ?!

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.140
Let's wait for a while.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.890
Analyzer.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.060
Please, forgive me !
We couldn't survive without it !

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.170
Forgive me !

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.710
Don't squash me !
Forgive me !

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:39.550
Forgive me !

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.210
Are you alright ?

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:24.010
It's so cruel.
They're like bees.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:27.660
They collect an
essence from themselves.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:31.110
Earth bees have a special
essence called royal jelly.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:35.690
Their body might
contain a lot of it.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:40.220
Royal jelly is used as
a stimulant for humans.  So...

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.120
Stop !

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:49.360
Don't worry. The people on
the Yamato will come for us.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.110
Don't lie to me.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.820
Communications
were cut off.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:29.320
You're operating it wrong. When
will you remember how to do it ?

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.110
That's better.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:40.430
Handle Gamilus equipment as
if you were facing Lord Desler.

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:44.890
This is Gamilus mining base
sector 8.  What's the matter ?

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.580
Today...rocket...arrive ?

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.710
You mean the {About the} tanker ?
Of course.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:55.500
You're supposed to deliver royal
essence to Gamilus every 500 days.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:59.150
The tanker has already
left the sector 8 base.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.220
It should arrive at
your planet on time.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.900
You have the essence
to deliver, don't you ?

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:06.180
I have.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:11.390
Good.  I'll inform
Lord Desler of your loyalty.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.310
Don't forget that your throne
is secure thanks to our Lord.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.310
Don't let your
loyalty waver.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.460
Unidentified object
at 1 o'clock.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:22.120
Captain, it appears to
be a Gamilus transport.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.520
Kodai, launch
the Black Tigers.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.100
Aye, sir.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.100
We'll probably be killed.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:23.070
Don't say that.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.290
What's with your calm look ?

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:31.670
You'll just become scrap parts,
so it may not be a big deal...

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:34.480
{NINGEN}...but death is a major
issue for a human.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.070
Chief...

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:41.460
You think that's all I am ?

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:46.460
My death means
I become scrap ?

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:52.040
{BOKU}Even I have a life.
It's a life a human gave to me.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:55.280
{NINGEN}I'm told that human
life was created by God.

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:57.360
{KAMISAMA}A life created by God...

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:01.480
{KAMISAMA}...or a life created by a human
shouldn't be valued any differently.

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:08.290
{BOKU}My life was created by a human,
and it has made me fall in love with you.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:12.560
{BOKU}My body is metal, and it's
certainly tougher than yours.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.820
{SONOBUN}So I'll fight for
you until I die.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:19.000
{ANATA}I won't let them kill you.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.300
{BOKU}I'll give my
life for you.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:28.110
Analyzer, your heart
is so human.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:28.960
Analyzer.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:47.470
Out.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:06.590
My Queen.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.050
It's Gamilus.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.210
Everyone, don't be deceived.

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:32.580
Don't be deceived
by the Queen.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.350
Everyone, look.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:06.490
You kill us, we kill
the Gamilusians.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:10.770
If Gamilusians are killed,
you'll be blamed.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.920
You'll be killed
by the Gamilusians.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.770
They think
we're from Gamilus.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.320
Gamilusians and Earthlings
look almost the same.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:36.520
Listen everyone, Gamilus takes
away our blood and our lives !

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:44.420
Gamilus, get out !
Resign, Queen !

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.350
Kill Gamilus.

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.690
Kill Queen.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:18:03.010
If you want to survive,
shoot the Gamilus tanker with that.

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.710
Kill Gamilus.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.930
Kill Queen.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.580
Kill Gamilus.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.960
Kill Queen.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.360
Queen...

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.620
Do it !

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:41.760
Kodai !

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.700
Sorry, I was late.  We took
a while to get the tanker.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.010
We're not Gamilusians !
We're Earthlings !

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.000
Don't misunderstand !

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.110
It doesn't matter if it's
Gamilusians or Earthlings !

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:03.950
They have the right to live peacefully
without anyone's interference !

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:08.060
Don't play innocent !
We came to steal vegetables, too !

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:08.890
Yuki...

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.520
Let's go.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.480
He doesn't die.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.180
Strange.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.290
It's a monster.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:29.150
I'm not a human,
but a robot.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.410
Analyzer...

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:19.580
The vegetable replenishment operation was
a failure, and I was scolded by the Captain...

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:21.070
...but he understood.

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:28.510
I'm sorry, Analyzer.

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:31.520
I appreciate your
feelings, but...

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.770
It's alright, Chief.

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:45.110
But I still love you.

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:49.450
There's nothing wrong
with loving someone, right ?

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:57.810
Analyzer...

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.970
There's only one year until mankind's
extinction due to Gamilus' radioactive poison.

00:23:12.970 --> 00:23:15.290
{SHIAWASE}When will peace return to Earth ?

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:21.260
{ISOGE}Hurry to Iscandar, Yamato.  Earth is
desperately waiting for your return.

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:24.120
{YAMATO}Ninety-five days have passed
since the Yamato left Earth.

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:27.590
{KOREKARA}There are still
270 days to go...

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:31.160
{JINRUI}...but only 267 days left until
the extinction of mankind.

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.110
267 days left till the destruction of Earth

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:35.460
Only 267 days left until
the extinction of mankind.

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:44.300
Okita Juzo:

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:44.300
Naya Goro

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:51.760
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:49.810
Mori Yuki:

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:49.810
Asagami Yoko

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:55.310
Aihara Giichi:

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:55.310
Nojima Shinji

00:23:51.760 --> 00:24:00.560
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:23:55.680 --> 00:24:05.180
Notes:
From the dialog of Analyzer in Ep. 9, the Yamato has an on board greenhouse, but they stopped at Bemera for fresh vegetables.

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:08.860
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:15.180
Notes:
Analyzer calls itself a genius, volunteered to be a Yamato crewmember, drinks sake, lifts up a Gamilus tank, flips up the skirt, and it lives as it desires. It finally proposes to Yuki.

00:24:08.860 --> 00:24:17.760
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:25.180
Note:
The story took place on Jan. 13, 2200,
the ninety-sixth day.
Yuki was rescued by Kodai and the other crew, but the vegetable replenishment mission failed.

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:25.180
Nobuhiro Okasako, who was hospitalized after the character background creation and pilot film making, returned as the director of animation.

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:26.160
In the hearts of men, who are
leaving on a long journey...{Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa}

00:24:25.710 --> 00:24:32.310
Translation

00:24:25.710 --> 00:24:32.310
Editing

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:33.760
...a piece of romance is needed.{Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa}

00:24:32.310 --> 00:24:39.880
Timing

00:24:32.310 --> 00:24:39.880
Song Translations

00:24:33.760 --> 00:24:37.760
La la la...

00:24:37.760 --> 00:24:41.760
La la la...

00:24:39.880 --> 00:24:47.880
A

00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:51.660
La la la, red scarf.{makka na scarf}
